dxe5 9. Qxd8 Rxd8 10. Bg5
{ Selected anchor ends here. Develop the c8 bishop, contest d4, and coordinate rooks on open files. Active pieces are more valuable than an automatic pawn storm. White resource: The d6 pawn has left d6. Reassess the center instead of continuing a closed-chain plan. }
10... Rf8 { Illustrative checked continuation, not a forced line. } *

