exd4 9. Nxd4 Re8
{ Selected anchor ends here. Develop the c8 bishop and examine ...Nxd4 when it improves the pieces. White may reinforce e4 or bring the bishop to f1. White resource: There is no locked d5 chain. A kingside pawn storm would ignore the open center. }
