Ne7 9. b4 Nh5 10. Re1 f5 11. Ng5 Nf6
{ Selected anchor ends here. Develop ...h6 only if it improves the tactical position, and consider ...a5 to question b4. White may trade on e6 or advance c5. White resource: The knight on h5 is not obliged to stay there. A retreat can complete the pawn break and improve coordination. }
