Ne7 9. b4 Nh5 10. Qc2 f5
{ Selected anchor ends here. Watch for exf5 and c5. Choose recaptures by development and king safety, not by a desire to preserve the same pawn picture. White resource: Qc2 and Re1 defend e4 in different ways; a combination from one line may fail in the other. }
